  "solution": "Logic : (1st number × 3rd number) = (2nd number ÷ 2)\n\nGiven : \n\n \n• (25, 150, 3)\n\n25 × 3 = 150 ÷ 2\n\n75 = 75 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• (18, 180, 5)\n\n18 × 5 = 180 ÷ 2\n\n90 = 90 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n \n• Option - (1) : (13, 39, 3)\n\n13 × 3 = 39 ÷ 2\n\n39 ≠ 19.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (2) : (101, 408, 2)\n\n101 × 2 = 408 ÷ 2\n\n202 ≠ 204 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (3) : (52, 728, 7)\n\n52 × 7 = 728 ÷ 2\n\n364 = 364 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• Option - (4) : (61, 601, 5)\n\n61 × 5 = 601 ÷ 2\n\n305 ≠ 300.5 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
